  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Traceability for export products and sustainability in Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: Traceability for export products and sustainability in Argentina - This action will enable the EU to address short and medium-term foreign policy needs and opportunities by supporting innovative policies/initiatives and by deepening EU relations and dialogues, forging alliances and partnerships. In particular, this action will strengthen the EU&#xbf;s bilateral and multilateral engagement with Argentina, Colombia and five countries[1] in Southeast Asia on the external impacts of EU Green Deal policies and regulatory frameworks with a special focus on deforestation and forest degradation.[1] Indonesia, Malaysia, Laos, Thailand, and Vietnam</narrative>
  </description>
